      </cm:relations>
      <cm:vname>
        <cm:mimedesc cm:id="iNA0_nOoI7h3xPIFT" cm:mimetype="text/plain" cm:encoding="utf-8">ps:fragment: Variable implementations with shared parts</cm:mimedesc>
      </cm:vname>
      <cm:desc>
        <cm:mimedesc cm:id="ibD6UEZ_9raTyXJFH" cm:mimetype="text/html" cm:encoding="utf-8">The ps:fragment source element in family models can be used to combine shared 
and variable parts into one file.
Class A has 2 different implementations of  constructor&amp;destructor but shares the same 
class declaration. The file is combined from ClassA_Decl.h plus ClassA_ImplVariant1.h or
ClassA_ImplVariant2.h. See System.ccfm</cm:mimedesc>
      </cm:desc>
    </cm:element>
